# cosmium patch: 0035-restrict-fonts-to-profile
# Authored: 2026-11-15
# Chromium base: 154.0.8037.57
#
# Describe the detection vector this patch fixes:
# - target file(s): third_party/blink/renderer/platform/fonts/font_cache.cc, content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
# - what changed: FontCache::GetFontData, IsPlatformFamilyMatchAvailable and IsPlatformFontUniqueNameMatchAvailable report a system font only when the family of the resolved typeface is listed in --cosmium-fonts, hiding host fonts from CSS, canvas measureText, document.fonts.check and local(); per-character fallback is untouched so text still renders
# - profile fields read: fonts.installed
# - test: cosmium test fingerprint (fonts_unlisted_hidden, fonts_listed_visible)
#
diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
